<section class="about-feature"><div class="editorial-image"><img src="/images/ripl-photos-077.jpg" alt="The RIPL team in their Fort Collins office"/></div><div class="about-copy"><div class="eyebrow">MEET RIPL</div><h1 class="about-title">A team that holds<br/>the full picture.</h1><p>Business, family, taxes, investments, and the future. Your financial life connects all of them. Your advisory relationship should too.</p><p>We built RIPL for capable people who have created something meaningful and want to see what comes next with greater clarity.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><h2>Every decision<br/>stays with you.</h2><div><p>Smart people make excellent decisions when they can see all of their options. Our role is to help you see those options, understand the tradeoffs, and choose what fits your life.</p><p>You get a team, a coordinated process, and people who know your situation. Serious work, clear explanations, and room to enjoy the relationship.</p></div></div></section><section class="section questions"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR TEAM</div><h2>Real people.<br/>Working together.</h2><div class="team-grid"><article><img src="/images/ripl-photos-115.jpg" alt="Chase Bellefeuille" loading="lazy"/><h3>Chase Bellefeuille</h3><span class="team-role">Founder</span><p>The thinking and philosophy behind RIPL. Connects the vision for your life with the strategy for your wealth.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://calendly.com/chase-riplwealth/talk-to-the-founder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book with Chase</a></article><article><div class="team-portrait team-portrait-adam"><img src="/images/ripl-photos-086-1-.jpg" alt="Adam Kasick" loading="lazy"/></div><h3>Adam Kasick</h3><span class="team-role">Wealth Manager</span><p>A business-owner perspective on organizing your financial life, understanding your options, and giving capital a purpose.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book with Adam</a></article><article><img src="/images/ashton.jpg" alt="Ashton Anderson" loading="lazy"/><h3>Ashton Anderson</h3><span class="team-role">Chief of Staff</span><p>The operational architect who helps the firm run with clarity and intention.</p></article><article><img src="/images/tasha.jpg" alt="Taska Skott" loading="lazy"/><h3>Taska Skott</h3><span class="team-role">Experience Lead</span><p>The standard of care behind every interaction. Thoughtful details and a welcoming experience.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Don’t worry about getting everything organized first.</h2><p>Tell us what’s on your mind. We’ll figure out what we actually need from there.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start the Conversation</a></div></section>
